          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>What distinguishes your speakers from others?</p>",
            "content": "<p>Our high-end speakers are designed with premium materials and advanced audio technology to deliver superior sound quality, which set them apart from standard models.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_da4bYH": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>What is the warranty coverage for your speakers?</p>",
            "content": "<p>We offer a comprehensive warranty for all our high-end products. Typically, this includes a 2-year warranty covering manufacturing defects and a 1-year warranty for the electrical components</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_X8aBi8": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>How do I connect multiple Bluetooth speakers for a surround sound experience?</p>",
            "content": "<p>To connect multiple speakers, turn on each speaker and activate their Bluetooth mode. Follow the pairing instructions in the user manual to connect the speakers to each other and then to your device. </p>"
          }
        },
        "collapse_fkpHCJ": {
          "type": "collapse",
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Are your speakers waterproof?</p>",
            "content": "<p>Yes, many of our Bluetooth speakers are designed to be waterproof and are rated IPX5 or higher, making them suitable for outdoor use, poolside gatherings, and even in the shower</p>"
          }
        }
      },
